## Tables and Figures

**IMPORTANT**: Always use captions for tables and figures:
- Tables: Add caption below with `{#tbl-label}` syntax: `: Caption text. {#tbl-label}`
- Figures: Add caption with `{#fig-label}` syntax: `![Caption](path){#fig-label}`
- Reference in text using `@tbl-label` or `@fig-label`

## Figures

To include in Quarto:
```markdown
![Caption](figures/filename.png){#fig-label width="80%"}
```

## References

Use BibTeX for all references. Cite with `@key` syntax in text.

## Commit Often

**IMPORTANT**: Commit changes frequently throughout report writing:
- After adding new sections
- After updating figures
- After completing drafts
- Before and after major edits

## Dependencies

- Quarto
- LuaLaTeX (for PDF rendering)
